    # The book's four maps (the Rhine Tribunal, pp.6-7; the Black Forest and the Upper Rhine, p49; Durenmar,
    # p53; the Rhine Gorge and Surrounding Lands, p120), as ^"Figure" records, and the table of realms printed beside the
    # Tribunal map (p7). The maps' lettering was read by eye (no text layer); the transcription and how it was made:
    # guardians-of-the-forests/figures.json.

    # source: page 6-7, read by eye from the art (no text layer; figures.json)
